# Vendored: qtermwidget

Upstream: https://github.com/lxqt/qtermwidget
Tag: 2.4.0 (Qt 6 native)
License: GPLv2+ (see LICENSE, LICENSE.BSD-3-clause, LICENSE.LGPL2+)

Vendored for use as a static library inside deepin-installer. Differences from
upstream:

* CMakeLists.txt is slimmed down: no lxqt-build-tools dependency, no
  pkg-config file, no install/export of the library itself, no example or
  python bindings, no translation build (SEARCHBAR .ts files dropped).
* kb-layouts/ and color-schemes/ are installed to
  ${CMAKE_INSTALL_DATADIR}/deepin-installer/qtermwidget6 at runtime instead of
  being bundled as .qrc resources. The private location avoids colliding with
  the system qtermwidget-data package.
